[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3124.069, "timestamp": "00:52:04", "text": "。所以，那就是五。  是的。五隻貓。給你的貓取名字"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3133.549, "timestamp": "00:52:13", "text": "。嗯，它們沒有悲傷的名字，但這是我給它們的名字。黑的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3136.51, "timestamp": "00:52:16", "text": "那個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3151.91, "timestamp": "00:52:31", "text": "是 Kurona。然後，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3165.99, "timestamp": "00:52:45", "text": "呃，還有一個白色的，而且很大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3169.349, "timestamp": "00:52:49", "text": "現在它從一隻小貓變成了一隻大貓。"}]